+# Password Hashing
+
+Nothing is currently recorded for this project's password hashing algorithm. A decision config (`config/decisions/revoke-password-hashing.json`) previously tracked this choice, but it was removed from the repository in the "move decision config out of the tree" commit, and no replacement record exists anywhere in the current tree. Until a new decision is recorded, this policy should not be treated as specifying any particular algorithm.
